      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a strong start. I like the phrasing \"unmask the ideological rigidity.\" \n\nTo make the essay more persuasive, could you expand on that second part? I want to really hammer home how the opposition's arguments aren't just different, but are actually intellectually bankrupt and fundamentally regressive. Can you add a few sentences that describe their specific rhetoric as a tool for maintaining outdated power structures?",
